  "notes": "扩展配置与脚本，面板换地址\n\n- 「扩展配置与脚本」可以写 YAML 和 JavaScript，在应用设置之后生效。随后应用会把自己的字段和自有域名规则写回去。\n- 规则可以前置或后置：前置排在订阅规则前面，后置排在订阅规则后面。\n- 扩展配置和脚本可以用于全部订阅，也可以在某一个订阅上单独设置。\n- 内置面板地址从 my.yue.to 改为 app.yue.to。已经安装的版本会回退到已签名的站点名单镜像。\n",
  "notesEn": "Extend config and scripts, and a new panel host\n\n- Extend config & scripts: write YAML and JavaScript that run after app settings. YueLink then writes its own fields and own-domain rules back.\n- Rules can be prepended or appended. Prepend rules run before the subscription's rules. Append rules run after them.\n- Extend config and scripts can apply to every subscription, or to one subscription.\n- The built-in panel host changed from my.yue.to to app.yue.to. Installed builds fall back to the signed site-roster mirrors.\n",
